---
const releases = 'https://github.com/colever-Beep/BilibiliDownloader/releases';
const platforms = [
  {
    name: 'Windows', note: 'Windows 10 / 11',
    items: [
      { label: '安装版 (exe)', desc: '双击安装，带开始菜单与卸载入口' },
      { label: '便携版 (zip)', desc: '免安装，可放 U 盘随用随走' },
    ],
  },
  {
    name: 'macOS', note: 'Apple Silicon / Intel',
    items: [
      { label: 'Apple Silicon (arm64)', desc: 'M 系列芯片 · .dmg / .app.zip' },
      { label: 'Intel (x86_64)', desc: '老款 Mac · .dmg / .app.zip' },
    ],
  },
  {
    name: 'Linux', note: 'x86_64 / ARM64',
    items: [
      { label: 'AppImage (x86_64)', desc: '赋予执行权限后直接运行' },
      { label: 'AppImage (aarch64)', desc: '树莓派 / ARM 设备' },
    ],
  },
];
---
<section id="download" class="section alt">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">下载</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">所有平台安装包均在 GitHub Releases 发布，开源免费。</p>
    <div class="dl-grid">
      {platforms.map((p) => (
        <div class="dl-card card">
          <div class="dl-head">
            <h3>{p.name}</h3>
            <small>{p.note}</small>
          </div>
          <ul class="dl-items">
            {p.items.map((it) => (
              <li><b>{it.label}</b><span>{it.desc}</span></li>
            ))}
          </ul>
          <a class="btn primary" href={releases} target="_blank" rel="noopener">前往 Releases 下载</a>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <p class="note">
      首次运行会自动下载 FFmpeg（约数十 MB）；macOS 包未做 Apple 公证，首次打开请右键「打开」，
      或在终端执行 <code>xattr -d com.apple.quarantine /Applications/BilibiliDownloader.app</code>。
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .dl-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 18px; }
  .dl-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .dl-head { margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .dl-head h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 18px; }
  .dl-head small { color: var(--text-soft); font-size: 13px; }
  .dl-items { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; flex: 1; }
  .dl-items li { display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; background: var(--bg-soft); }
  .dl-items b { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text); }
  .dl-items span { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-soft); margin-top: 2px; }
  .dl-card .btn { width: 100%; }
  .note { text-align: center; color: var(--text-soft); font-size: 13px; margin-top: 24px; line-height: 1.8; }
</style>
